FOR EACH MILESTONE
A. Explain the goal in simple language.
B. List the files to be changed.
C. Implement the smallest complete version.
D. Add or update automated tests.
E. Run relevant lint, type-check, unit tests, and build commands that exist in this repository.
F. Report the exact commands run and whether each passed or failed.
G. Give me beginner-friendly manual test instructions.
H. State known limitations and the next milestone.
I. Stop and wait for my approval before beginning the next milestone.

